{#
  Gallery's media grid: the square thumbnails that open the lightbox.

  Its own partial so that a module hosting a DELEGATED album — a discussion
  group's photos, say — shows its members the same grid, with the same
  lightbox, as any other album. The alternative, which is what groups had,
  is a second grid whose cells open each photo in a new browser tab: the
  same media, a visibly worse page, and two places to fix anything.

  Requires `rows`, a list of `{media, thumb_url, medium_url}`. `media` needs only
  `mediaType` and `processingStatus` — true of both gallery's own
  Repository\Media and Api\DelegatedMedia, which is what lets one grid serve
  both.

  The caller renders partials/lightbox.html.twig once and loads
  assets/js/gallery.js; this partial only produces the triggers.

  Never a broken image: 'pending'/'processing' shows a spinner and 'failed' a
  discreet notice, so a photo still being resized never renders as a broken
  icon on somebody's phone.
#}
<div class="row g-2" id="gallery-media-grid">
    {% for row in rows %}
        {% set m = row.media %}
        <div class="col-4 col-md-3 col-lg-2">
            <button type="button" class="btn p-0 border-0 w-100 position-relative gallery-lightbox-trigger"
                    style="aspect-ratio:1/1;overflow:hidden;background:#eee;"
                    data-index="{{ loop.index0 }}"
                    data-type="{{ m.mediaType }}"
                    data-medium-url="{{ row.medium_url }}"
                    {#
                      Where the lightbox's single "Télécharger en haute qualité"
                      points. Always the application's own route, never the
                      rendition's URL: with S3 storage that one is cross-origin,
                      where the browser ignores `download` outright and names the
                      file after the storage key
                      (Controller\GalleryController::downloadMedia()).
                    #}
                    data-download-url="/gallery/media/{{ m.id }}/download">
                {% if m.processingStatus == 'done' %}
                    <img src="{{ row.thumb_url }}" alt="" class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy">
                    {% if m.mediaType == 'video' %}
                        <span class="position-absolute top-50 start-50 translate-middle text-white"
                              style="font-size:2rem;text-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,.6);">
                            <i class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </span>
                    {% endif %}
                {% elseif m.processingStatus == 'failed' %}
                    <span class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center h-100 text-danger"
                          title="Échec du traitement">
                        <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    </span>
                {% else %}
                    <span class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center h-100 text-body-secondary"
                          title="Traitement en cours">
                        <span class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm"></span>
                    </span>
                {% endif %}
            </button>
        </div>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
